  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Water Resource Management in IDP Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The three-year program will improve the immediate access to water supply, irrigation infrastructure at the watershed level, and community-led resource and conflict management to improve the overall resilience of target communities (with a focus on areas hosting large, displaced populations) to cyclical shocks.</narrative>
  </description>
